Hey there! This is Gao, one of the developers of “Shio”. We're excited to announce that we've pushed our “easy mode” update for Shio on the official edition. And thank you everyone for your support.

What's New?
1.Added EASY MODE—Dream Lightly;
2.The save and game progress of the TWO MODE are separated;
3.The hidden challenge part is unavailable in the easy mode;
4.Added Fat Boy's Time as the time challenging in the easy mode
 
Gameplay Mechanics Fixed:
Except the easy mode, we fixed some orther problem in this update:
1.Modified the action of strucking lanterns;
2.The steaming trading cards, badges and backgrounds are still in review. When these come out, we would put on another announcement.

Bug Fixed:
1. Fixed the BUG in chapter 4, when previous levels is optioned after the wood board collapse, the board won't reconvert;
2.Fixed the BUG in chapter 4 when switch levels, the perspective convert errored;
3.Fixed the BUG when switching levels, the interface image shows unexpectedly;
4.Fixed the BUG that the charactor may drop out the scene in some position;
5.Fixed the BUG that the wood board would collapse when character touches the side face;
6.Updated the challenging time in Chapter 4 Level 1 in the hard mode;
7.Fixed the orther problems.

Let us know what you think to make sure you're really really really “enjoy” this game!

Sleepy-bug-fixing-overwhelmed Peter Ge

